  "approach": "Teach once to veinte by their two patterns (11 to 15 are their own words; 16 to 19 are \"ten and ...\") with audio, then retrieve them in prices and ages.",
  "coverage": [
    "once, doce, trece, catorce, quince are their own words",
    "They echo 1 to 5: on-ce, do-ce, tre-ce, cator-ce, quin-ce",
    "16 to 19 are diez y (ten and) fused into one word: dieciséis, diecisiete, dieciocho, diecinueve",
    "The z of diez becomes c in dieci-",
    "Dieciséis carries a written accent",
    "veinte = 20",
    "Common confusion: doce (12) and dos (2); trece (13) and tres (3)"
  ],
